From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:43:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let a theme set the gap between a menu value and its chevron

A row's value (a host name, a hidden password, a path) ended about
3 px before its chevron on a 640 px wide screen, so the two read as
one word.

menutext gains valueSpacing, the space between a row's value and its
chevron; the default stays half a percent of the screen's width.
---
 THEMES.md                                     |    4 +-
 es-app/src/guis/GuiGamelistFilter.cpp         |    2 +-
 es-app/src/guis/GuiGamelistOptions.cpp        | 1408 ++++++++---------
 .../src/guis/GuiGeneralScreensaverOptions.cpp |    4 +-
 es-app/src/guis/GuiMetaDataEd.cpp             |    4 +-
 es-app/src/guis/GuiSettings.cpp               |    4 +-
 es-core/src/ThemeData.cpp                     |    5 +
 es-core/src/ThemeData.h                       |    3 +-
 8 files changed, 721 insertions(+), 713 deletions(-)

diff --git a/THEMES.md b/THEMES.md
index 35d1dccf..42505f0d 100644
--- a/THEMES.md
+++ b/THEMES.md
@@ -842,7 +842,7 @@ ES versions with slides support the feature `slideshow`.
 	- The tiles of a menu's image grid (the save states)
 * `menuKeyboard name="menukeyboard"` - PATH | FOCUSEDPATH | ACTIVEPATH | CORNERSIZE | SPACING | FONTPATH | FONTSIZE | COLOR | SELECTEDCOLOR | WORDKEYS | FOCUSKEYS
 	- The on-screen keyboard's keys
-* `menuText name="menutext"` - FONTPATH | FONTSIZE | COLOR | ROWHEIGHT | ROWPADDING | ICONSIZE | FULLROWS
+* `menuText name="menutext"` - FONTPATH | FONTSIZE | COLOR | ROWHEIGHT | ROWPADDING | ICONSIZE | FULLROWS | VALUESPACING
 	- text for all menu entries
 * `menuText name="menutitle"` - FONTPATH | FONTSIZE | COLOR
 	- text for menu titles
@@ -1476,6 +1476,8 @@ BATOCERA 5.24
 	- The height of the rows' icons (menuIcons), as a fraction of the screen height. Default: 1.25 times the text's letter height.
 * `fullRows` - type: BOOLEAN. (`menutext` only)
 	- Lists show whole rows only: they scroll by rows and leave out a row they cannot show whole. Default is false.
+* `valueSpacing` - type: FLOAT. (`menutext` only)
+	- The space between a row's value and its chevron, as a fraction of the screen width. Default is 0.005.
 	
 
 #### menuSwitch
diff --git a/es-app/src/guis/GuiGamelistFilter.cpp b/es-app/src/guis/GuiGamelistFilter.cpp
